! {{$:/plugins/wikilabs/scroll-memory/icon}} Scroll Memory Plugin

This plugin keeps your reading position when you navigate the story river. Scroll positions of long tiddlers are remembered, link clicks leave landmarks you can return to, and closing a tiddler brings you back to the place where you followed its link.

!! Try it

Open the [[Scroll Memory Documentation]] and scroll down into it. Follow some of its links, then use the floating buttons at the bottom right to get back to where you were.

!! Settings

Every behaviour has a switch in ''$:/ControlPanel -> Settings -> WikiLabs -> Scroll Memory''. See [[Settings]] for what each one does.

